The MIT licence above covers the SNITCH source code only. It does NOT relicense
the third-party data this project reads. Those carry their own terms, and
attribution is mandatory — see the Attribution section of README.md:

  - Global Forest Watch integrated deforestation alerts (GLAD-L, GLAD-S2, RADD,
    DIST-ALERT), © World Resources Institute, licensed CC BY 4.0.
  - GLEIF Global LEI Index, OFAC Specially Designated Nationals List, and the
    EU Consolidated Financial Sanctions List, each under their publishers' terms.
  - Universal Mill List, Unilever Palm Oil Mills, and Oil Palm Concessions
    (ArcGIS Hub re-uploads) — provenance is stated per feature in the UI, and
    licensing on the concession layer is unclear, which is why user-uploaded
    GeoJSON remains the primary path.
  - Esri World Imagery and OpenStreetMap contributors for basemaps.

MapLibre GL JS worker files vendored in public/maplibre/ are copied verbatim
from the maplibre-gl package and remain under its own BSD-3-Clause licence; see
public/maplibre/SOURCE.txt.
